<title>JAPAN: BOJ governor to speak in parliament from 0648 GMT.</title>
<headline>BOJ governor to speak in parliament from 0648 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will attend a parliamentary committee meeting on Friday, the BOJ said in a statement.</p>
<p>Matsushita will answer questions from a member of the Upper House's special committee on administrative reform and tax system between 3.48 p.m. and 4.02 p.m. (0648-0702 GMT), the BOJ said.</p>
</text>
